WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.110
- I heard that you lost your phone.

00:00:02.110 --> 00:00:04.290
I would freak out. Well I have
kids, so I would freak out.

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.740
- Listen, I was scrambling.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:06.820
I don't know if you guys have done this,

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.100
but I guess I love my phone.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:10.010
I don't even notice.

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:13.190
But it was fizzling out of batteries

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.090
and something was wrong.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.270
So, sometimes that little
hole in the bottom,

00:00:16.270 --> 00:00:17.330
it gets a little fuzz in there,

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:19.320
so it won't, it was losing a charge.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.230
So, I stuck a safety pin
in there to clean it out.

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:23.208
Mistake!

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:24.041
(crowd laughter)

00:00:24.041 --> 00:00:26.020
You don't even have to go
to DeVry to know that one.

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.947
I was like, (mimics buzzing sound).

00:00:26.947 --> 00:00:27.780
- DeVry.

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.707
- and then it starts going, "Vuvuvuvu."

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:32.680
And I'm like 36% (humming a tune)

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.210
28% going, it's, what
happens when it's over?

00:00:35.210 --> 00:00:36.810
It won't charge, so it's done.

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.617
It's, so I get to the iPhone
store, and they're like,

00:00:38.617 --> 00:00:40.400
"clear" (mimics sound of CPR)

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.410
like it's really ICU,

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:44.600
And then they get a
little (buzzing noise).

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.460
They get it going.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:49.030
But man for 16 hours, that
should be the internet challenge.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:51.330
16 hours I did not have my phone.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.580
I don't even know how to drive,
(crowd laughter) without.

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:54.447
I was like,

00:00:54.447 --> 00:00:55.280
- You didn't know where to go?

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.113
- What do I just look at (beep)?

00:00:56.113 --> 00:00:57.612
You know what I mean?

00:00:57.612 --> 00:00:58.445
(laughter)

00:00:58.445 --> 00:01:01.104
I'm like, where do I put my
hands on the steering wheel?

00:01:01.104 --> 00:01:01.937
(laughter and applause)

00:01:01.937 --> 00:01:03.504
Hey, there's trees on my street.

00:01:03.504 --> 00:01:04.830
- (laughing) Trees on my street...

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:07.992
- I know I go, look, you
guys, there's trees all over.

00:01:07.992 --> 00:01:08.825
(crowd laughter)

